    {
      "path": "docs/implementation-plan.md",
      "line": 3,
      "kinds": [
        "protocol_capture_audit"
      ],
      "text": "**Goal:** Build and publish a pure-MoonBit offline PCAP/PCAPNG parser, protocol decoder, TCP reassembler, flow analyzer, and native CLI with deterministic cross-backend behavior.",
      "excerpt_start_column": 1,
      "match_column": 44
    },
    {
      "path": "docs/implementation-plan.md",
      "line": 105,
      "kinds": [
        "protocol_capture_audit"
      ],
      "text": "- [x] Implement `detect_capture`, global-header validation, timestamp conversion with overflow checks, and record iteration. Preserve `captured_len`, `original_len`, `link_type`, and source offset.",
      "excerpt_start_column": 1,
      "match_column": 25
    },
    {
      "path": "docs/implementation-plan.md",
      "line": 130,
      "kinds": [
        "protocol_capture_audit"
      ],
      "text": "- [ ] Run `moon test -p src/capture`; verify the PCAPNG cases fail while classic PCAP remains green.",
      "excerpt_start_column": 1,
      "match_column": 29
    },
    {
      "path": "docs/implementation-plan.md",
      "line": 160,
      "kinds": [
        "protocol_capture_audit"
      ],
      "text": "**Interfaces:** Consumes `LinkFrame`; produces `NetworkPacket` with validated source/destination, protocol number, payload, fragmentation metadata, and diagnostics. Fragmented payload is exposed but not reassembled in v0.1.",
      "excerpt_start_column": 1,
      "match_column": 56
    },
    {
      "path": "docs/implementation-plan.md",
      "line": 264,
      "kinds": [
        "protocol_capture_audit"
      ],
      "text": "**Interfaces:** Consumes public capture/packet/flow/diagnostic values; produces schema-versioned stable bytes. CLI implements `summary`, `packets`, `flows`, `extract`, and `validate` with documented stdout/stderr and exit-code contracts.",
      "excerpt_start_column": 1,
      "match_column": 139
    },
